{"steam_appid":4160880,"steam_name":"Ember Seeker","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4160880/1817607682/072c74ab95f89ca7c80e1855cc1921cc20c31d53/1779216474/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1779217355","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257339596/571142b5e3d89589340bb749245c98f9951d91ab/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1779217355","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160880/1a2a25522c7fa4ca01759bf4969e9578a0e75827/ss_1a2a25522c7fa4ca01759bf4969e9578a0e75827.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781504764","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160880/5fc64873238f8d60d40967bcbef86c5653a3d4e4/ss_5fc64873238f8d60d40967bcbef86c5653a3d4e4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781504764","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160880/14bb138d25df166289b6e6e07fc3fc6e674d3b49/ss_14bb138d25df166289b6e6e07fc3fc6e674d3b49.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781504764","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160880/5f0b9e9d7792e89c454e6df24b3fccb707d9a0e6/ss_5f0b9e9d7792e89c454e6df24b3fccb707d9a0e6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781504764","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160880/a26488d0265e792326c4527520ecfc2fbdd73ce9/ss_a26488d0265e792326c4527520ecfc2fbdd73ce9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781504764"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in a land that was once home to a thriving civilisation but it has since become eerily quiet with only a few remaining inhabitants. With no real recollection of your past or how you  ended up in this place, you try to uncover the truth about what really happened here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE A MAGICAL OPEN WORLD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land has been plunged into an eternal night. Navigate across the foggy landscapes and get lost in discovering the unkown. Explore eery forests,  towering mountainscapes and imposing castles while meeting curious individuals who might aid you on your journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160880/extras/cfa81f9eea830aa8b37931411e2df87a.poster.avif?t=1781504764\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160880/extras/cfa81f9eea830aa8b37931411e2df87a.webm?t=1781504764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160880/extras/cfa81f9eea830aa8b37931411e2df87a.mp4?t=1781504764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCOVER THE UNKOWN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasures, hidden secrets and lost journals can be found  in every corner of the land. They can grant you special abilities and aid you along your journey in many different ways. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rings that grant special powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Useful tools like lanterns that light up your surroundings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journals containing all sorts of useful information</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other magical artifacts</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160880/extras/89b018e694eb396a23f5a3846c19f30b.poster.avif?t=1781504764\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160880/extras/89b018e694eb396a23f5a3846c19f30b.webm?t=1781504764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160880/extras/89b018e694eb396a23f5a3846c19f30b.mp4?t=1781504764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPERIENCE TIMELESS RETRO GRAPHICS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classical retro pixel-graphics combined with modern technology, effects and beautiful music help you get immersed in the atmospheric and hand-crafted world of Ember Seeker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160880/extras/8bb1c9ace0793e0e3bd708b0f2a783fe.poster.avif?t=1781504764\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160880/extras/8bb1c9ace0793e0e3bd708b0f2a783fe.webm?t=1781504764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160880/extras/8bb1c9ace0793e0e3bd708b0f2a783fe.mp4?t=1781504764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> yes<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  NVIDIA GeForce GTX 900 Series<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["Lehti E."],"publishers":["Lehti E."],"release_date":"Jun 14, 2026"}